      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de11ad739a191b20cf9df72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起成为名流吧，训练员亲♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b26a67b5a22259d9fc5daf4fc8285324a140d97b9165c00f7f94293466f7dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c1fab05070393967ede21c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你相遇的那天我就感觉到了♪\r\n你比任何人都温柔且优秀♡\r\n……真的，没骗你哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d135496954e67e80212bb6d9139b73916cf4a4f3bf28d310a9559e3fc221d8c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5ccc5bcc763e0cd2a5b2303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大大的蝴蝶结和轻飘飘的褶边，\r\n都超可爱超喜欢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbb41c6836d025e624b9d1bd28317acb3aab16156abee160feb6c29583ecd48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e5a7c64eee9baa7b5e0984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好有闪闪发光的感觉。\r\n蓬松的下摆是很好的得分点♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9108fa59bbae4fed163d6395a8cb280617e0a8470fba4407de717a47798a8801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b0075d38f782da5b895c514",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样怎么样？\r\n这种轻飘可爱的感觉！\r\n要说的话也就只有那句了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d43f88add55bc58a0afd3de4a7180b78e4e346c25598d652771a6f1e4691d81e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ee632329a9f021cffea3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的穿着很不错！\r\n配色和样式都很完美对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "247a63e2442824618feeef2cedf7a99a406f4a66d63876ad3737132b0a1aad29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de1545e65f01b21ae5c4ce3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家都很可爱，\r\n但是在舞台上还是希望能\r\n只看着我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1ba3b6d808705181aafba026a481e224cc24f78f98ef065ac6daab1af133ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
