      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d7315cc3e165df0418b48d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好训练员亲♪\r\n今天也要度过闪耀又悸动的一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cc9141892cac3754622ec3d845ea764d00840a18334aac6bc9c0db450220bdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f62c506e21c6722308f2eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐说过只喝果汁可不好~\r\n我有好好地在吃早饭哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f04440933ff1fe0d08ed53d91fcfeb4026f47cd310c636fea36b779e9ce5e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9326b84b3f2c397b49b3d76e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员亲有感觉很棒吗？\r\n因为见到了训练员亲，\r\n我现在感觉超棒♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cdad12b1ae7b1dab3a25aa74723e5bed3b19add09b3d02301f75b6ef44918bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d982eb5bab18983e4bced1e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练之前先喝喝茶吧！\r\n我还不想就这么结束快乐的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09ef0bf679dd575ebb73603320e0ec4656e2e01b5a23459bccc32fb289ab9215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6ce9daab9600adfb786ba0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作辛苦了。\r\n是为了我的比赛才这么努力的吧？\r\n欸嘿，好开心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "555bc6334a90c91fbf0fe9daeebeee6934658b614755f2983c650f54162e6318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
